    "category": "Automatic catchweigher",
    "type_designations": ["HI-700", "WI-700", "CW-700", "HI-700SF", "WI-700SF", "CW-700SF", "MI-700", "AP-700 UB"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Automatic catchweigher designated HI-700, operating as an automatic weight or weight/price labeller (Category Y); designated CW-700 when configured to operate only as an automatic checkweigher (category X). Comprises a self-indicating and price-computing weighing machine with associated thermal label printer and mechanical handling facilities, designed to weigh packs dynamically. The weigher and labeller are mounted on a single fabricated floor-standing stainless steel frame on adjustable feet. The weighing system comprises a scale conveyor mounted on a load cell (HBM PW15); pack detection by photocells. Control cabinet houses the electronics (Teraoka SBC-710 SBC Controller, ADC power supply, DSP A/D conversion PCB); display via colour LCD touch screen. Access to metrological settings secured by switch on the A/D board in a metal case with tamper-evident seal; static calibration password protected with audit count number."
